# What a build may read of the working tree, and nothing else: no .env, no
# data, no Excel files, no tests.
*
# Task 31: the server's image, only the jar that ./mvnw verify built.
!target/insurance-office-*.jar
# Task 39b: the demo's image builds its jar from these (Dockerfile, "build").
!mvnw
!pom.xml
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.properties
!src/main
# Never, not even under src/main (.gitignore).
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls
**/*.csv
**/*.db
**/.env
